{"id":3140,"date":"2025-12-11T16:03:13","date_gmt":"2025-12-11T16:03:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3140"},"modified":"2026-02-15T19:35:05","modified_gmt":"2026-02-15T19:35:05","slug":"cardboard-vr-headset-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-vr-headset-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard VR Headset Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"49\">Cardboard VR Headset Boxes For Secure Tech Use<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"682\">Cardboard VR headset boxes give virtual reality devices a stable home from the factory line to the end user, keeping headsets, straps, and extras in one organised place. Many tech brands also use <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-smartwatch-packaging-boxes\/\"><strong>Cardboard Smartwatch Packaging Boxes<\/strong><\/a> when they want matching packaging for companion devices like watches, trackers, or small controllers. This shared approach keeps the shelf presentation consistent and helps customers recognise the full product family at a glance. The firm structure of VR headset packs supports the headset shell, holds straps in position, and keeps accessories from shifting into the viewing area during transport.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"1264\">A well-built VR box also supports storage and returns handling, because the same cavity that holds a new unit can keep refurbished or serviced devices in order. Clean internal walls and shaped inserts reduce the risk of scratches on lenses or housings when boxes are stacked or moved through delivery chains. Brands can work with different depths and footprints for wired, wireless, and all-in-one models while keeping the outer style consistent. Over time, this makes it easier to train packing teams, align retail displays, and keep the unboxing feel similar for every customer.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1320\">Interior Layouts That Stabilise VR Device Hardware<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1853\">VR headsets include sensitive lenses, sensors, straps, and sometimes controllers that all need a predictable position inside the pack. Cardboard VR headset boxes use shaped inserts, pads, or simple dividers to separate these elements so they do not collide when the box is handled. A flat, supportive base keeps the main headset body steady, while top clearance prevents pressure on the front or lens area. This balance between support and breathing room helps devices reach customers looking as neat as they did in product photos.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"2356\">The same interior layout can be tuned for bundle versions with extra cables or grip attachments. Channels or side pockets give these pieces a natural spot, reducing the need for extra pouches that might move around. When boxes are opened in a store demo, at an exhibition, or at home, customers can see the device and accessories laid out clearly. This builds confidence in the product and also makes it easier to repack the headset after use, which helps keep everything together for future sessions.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2410\"><strong data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2410\">Handling And Protection Benefits For VR Headsets<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2963\">\n<li data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2480\">\n<p data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2480\">Keeps the headset shell supported, so it holds its original shape<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2547\">\n<p data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2547\">Reduces pressure damage on lenses, bands, and sensitive panels<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2620\">\n<p data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2620\">Supports a light but firm overall feel that works well for shipments<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2689\">\n<p data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2689\">Leaves dedicated space for straps, cables, and small accessories<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2758\">\n<p data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2758\">Limits the movement of controllers or add-ons inside the main cavity<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2823\">\n<p data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2823\">Helps maintain alignment when cartons are stacked in transit<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2893\">\n<p data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2893\">Gives staff a simple structure to follow when packing each device<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2894\" data-end=\"2963\">\n<p data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2963\">Makes the interior layout clear when customers first open the box<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3019\"><strong data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3019\">Operational Advantages During Packing And Delivery<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3568\">\n<li data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3078\">\n<p data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3078\">Supports cost planning needs without losing structure<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3079\" data-end=\"3147\">\n<p data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3147\">Helps teams manage all headset components in one organised space<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3221\">\n<p data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3221\">Reduces surface marks and scratches through secure internal placement<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3222\" data-end=\"3288\">\n<p data-start=\"3224\" data-end=\"3288\">Makes unboxing feel simple, tidy, and guided for new customers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3358\">\n<p data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3358\">Allows clear labelling and branding on outer panels and lid areas<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3433\">\n<p data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"3433\">Works with standard shipping cartons and pallet layouts for tech goods<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3500\">\n<p data-start=\"3436\" data-end=\"3500\">Keeps repacking straightforward for returns, demos, or repairs<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3568\">\n<p data-start=\"3503\" data-end=\"3568\">Adapts to both direct-to-consumer and retail distribution flows<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"4365\">\n<thead data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3697\">\n<tr data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3697\">\n<th data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3584\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3583\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3584\" data-end=\"3598\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3597\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3621\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3620\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3621\" data-end=\"3645\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3623\" data-end=\"3644\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3645\" data-end=\"3672\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3671\">Add-Ons And Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3672\" data-end=\"3697\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3695\">Usage Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"4365\">\n<tr data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3881\">\n<td data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3743\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Device stability<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"3778\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Holds headset firmly in position<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3799\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft, rigid board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3820\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte, light gloss<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3844\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interior support pads<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"3881\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Retail packaging and product kits<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3882\" data-end=\"4045\">\n<td data-start=\"3882\" data-end=\"3899\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Weight support<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3899\" data-end=\"3942\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Carries headset and accessories together<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3942\" data-end=\"3970\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated or strong card<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3970\" data-end=\"3992\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Protective UV layer<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3992\" data-end=\"4010\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Divider inserts<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4045\" data-col-size=\"sm\">E-commerce and courier delivery<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4203\">\n<td data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4062\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Print quality<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4062\" data-end=\"4101\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Supports detailed branding and icons<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4101\" data-end=\"4120\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SBS board stocks<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4120\" data-end=\"4141\" data-col-size=\"sm\">High-clarity print<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4141\" data-end=\"4167\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Logo and graphic panels<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4167\" data-end=\"4203\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tech retail shelves and displays<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4204\" data-end=\"4365\">\n<td data-start=\"4204\" data-end=\"4221\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Design options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4264\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Works with different VR model footprints<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4264\" data-end=\"4290\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Thick paperboard grades<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4290\" data-end=\"4313\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Smooth outer coating<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4313\" data-end=\"4334\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Extra compartments<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4334\" data-end=\"4365\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Home storage and demo units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 data-start=\"4372\" data-end=\"4431\">Flip Style VR Headset Boxes For Confident Retail Display<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4433\" data-end=\"4967\">Flip-style VR headset boxes give brands a steady way to present devices on shelves, demo tables, and in shipping cartons without feeling bulky. Sourcing teams often turn to <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/Cardboard-Boxes-By-Functionality\/\"><strong data-start=\"151\" data-end=\"187\">Cardboard Boxes By Functionality<\/strong><\/a> when they want VR packs to sit alongside other tech packaging, such as controller boxes or accessory cases, within one logical system. A flip or hinged format lets staff open the pack quickly for checks or demos while keeping the device anchored in its base. This helps the headset look ready for use whenever the lid is lifted.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4969\" data-end=\"5475\">The structure can be adjusted so some boxes open from the front for counter demos, while others tilt from the top for retail displays or online unboxings. In each case, the inner tray or insert stops the VR unit from sliding forward when the box is moved. Extra side strength supports stacking in storerooms and warehouses, especially when shipments include multiple units per carton. The overall effect is a pack that travels reliably and still feels composed when it reaches a store or customer&#8217;s doorstep.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"5477\" data-end=\"5529\">Building Trust In Shipping And Shelf Performance<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5531\" data-end=\"5968\">VR devices often travel long distances and may be repacked for returns or display, so the packaging needs to cope with repeated handling. Flip-style cardboard VR headset boxes give the headset a secure base that can handle lifting, tilting, and brief drops better than loose or undersized packaging. Reinforced corners and well-placed folds reduce the risk of crushed edges when cartons are stacked in distribution centres or stockrooms.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5970\" data-end=\"6452\">In retail, the same box becomes part of the story that surrounds the headset on the shelf. Clear branding, simple product information, and a tidy opening gesture help customers understand what they are buying. When the pack performs well in both shipping and display roles, brands gain confidence that each device is being presented consistently. This reliability becomes important when planning product launches, seasonal campaigns, and long-running lines that ship in high volume.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6454\" data-end=\"6510\"><strong data-start=\"6454\" data-end=\"6510\">Presentation And Logistics Benefits For Tech Sellers<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"6512\" data-end=\"7045\">\n<li data-start=\"6512\" data-end=\"6580\">\n<p data-start=\"6514\" data-end=\"6580\">Helps keep the headset shape intact through long delivery routes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6581\" data-end=\"6647\">\n<p data-start=\"6583\" data-end=\"6647\">Supports clean placement on tech store shelves and demo stands<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6648\" data-end=\"6715\">\n<p data-start=\"6650\" data-end=\"6715\">Reduces knocks and bumps that might affect the lens or sensor areas<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6716\" data-end=\"6780\">\n<p data-start=\"6718\" data-end=\"6780\">Makes packing accessories and documentation easier for staff<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6781\" data-end=\"6840\">\n<p data-start=\"6783\" data-end=\"6840\">Works with standard shelf depths and display planograms<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6841\" data-end=\"6908\">\n<p data-start=\"6843\" data-end=\"6908\">Accepts barcodes, seals, and tags without cluttering the design<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6909\" data-end=\"6977\">\n<p data-start=\"6911\" data-end=\"6977\">Supports both lay-flat and upright display positions when needed<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6978\" data-end=\"7045\">\n<p data-start=\"6980\" data-end=\"7045\">Gives room for clear imagery and VR feature summaries on panels<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"7047\" data-end=\"7103\"><strong data-start=\"7047\" data-end=\"7103\">Support For Commercial And Distribution Requirements<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"7105\" data-end=\"7701\">\n<li data-start=\"7105\" data-end=\"7164\">\n<p data-start=\"7107\" data-end=\"7164\">Helps meet distribution needs across different channels<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7165\" data-end=\"7244\">\n<p data-start=\"7167\" data-end=\"7244\">Improves brand confidence when shipping devices through e-commerce networks<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7245\" data-end=\"7323\">\n<p data-start=\"7247\" data-end=\"7323\">Makes it easier to arrange cables, straps, and manuals in their own spaces<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7324\" data-end=\"7405\">\n<p data-start=\"7326\" data-end=\"7405\">Minimises direct contact between the headset and outer edges during transport<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7406\" data-end=\"7487\">\n<p data-start=\"7408\" data-end=\"7487\">Allows warehouses to stack units in predictable patterns on pallets and racks<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7488\" data-end=\"7564\">\n<p data-start=\"7490\" data-end=\"7564\">Supports labelling for serial numbers, warranty details, and model types<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7565\" data-end=\"7629\">\n<p data-start=\"7567\" data-end=\"7629\">Works with security tagging used in tech retail environments<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7630\" data-end=\"7701\">\n<p data-start=\"7632\" data-end=\"7701\">Adapts to regional packaging needs without changing the core format<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"7703\" data-end=\"8539\">\n<thead data-start=\"7703\" data-end=\"7830\">\n<tr data-start=\"7703\" data-end=\"7830\">\n<th data-start=\"7703\" data-end=\"7717\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"7705\" data-end=\"7716\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"7717\" data-end=\"7731\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"7719\" data-end=\"7730\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"7731\" data-end=\"7754\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"7733\" data-end=\"7753\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"7754\" data-end=\"7778\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"7756\" data-end=\"7777\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"7778\" data-end=\"7805\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"7780\" data-end=\"7804\">Add-Ons And Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"7805\" data-end=\"7830\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"7807\" data-end=\"7828\">Usage Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"7857\" data-end=\"8539\">\n<tr data-start=\"7857\" data-end=\"8014\">\n<td data-start=\"7857\" data-end=\"7872\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Box strength<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7872\" data-end=\"7908\" data-col-size=\"md\">Carries the full VR device weight<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7908\" data-end=\"7935\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated, kraft blends<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7935\" data-end=\"7957\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte or soft gloss<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7957\" data-end=\"7984\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Extra depth where needed<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7984\" data-end=\"8014\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tech shipments and storage<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"8015\" data-end=\"8187\">\n<td data-start=\"8015\" data-end=\"8033\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interior layout<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8033\" data-end=\"8073\" data-col-size=\"md\">Helps place headset and extras safely<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8073\" data-end=\"8099\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SBS board or rigid card<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8099\" data-end=\"8124\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Smooth interior finish<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8124\" data-end=\"8152\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accessory slots and wells<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8152\" data-end=\"8187\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Device storage and display kits<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"8188\" data-end=\"8363\">\n<td data-start=\"8188\" data-end=\"8207\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Shipping support<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8207\" data-end=\"8251\" data-col-size=\"md\">Withstands courier and warehouse handling<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8251\" data-end=\"8282\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fiberboard and strong liners<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8282\" data-end=\"8306\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Anti-scratch surfaces<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8306\" data-end=\"8330\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reinforced side walls<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8330\" data-end=\"8363\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Regional distribution centres<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"8364\" data-end=\"8539\">\n<td data-start=\"8364\" data-end=\"8378\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Brand value<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8378\" data-end=\"8421\" data-col-size=\"md\">Shows high-quality printing and graphics<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8421\" data-end=\"8453\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Paperboard with print coating<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8453\" data-end=\"8472\" data-col-size=\"sm\">PMS inks or CMYK<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8472\" data-end=\"8499\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Feature and story panels<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8499\" data-end=\"8539\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tech retail spaces and launch events<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 data-start=\"8546\" data-end=\"8604\">Structured VR Headset Packs For Organised Storage Flows<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"8606\" data-end=\"9170\">Cardboard VR headset boxes also support long-term storage and in-house organisation for brands, schools, gaming venues, and training centres. Many electronics sellers plan families of packs through <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong>Custom Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> so VR units, accessories, and related gear share a consistent look across product ranges. A structured headset pack lets each model, from compact designs to larger premium headsets, sit in a dedicated space that staff can recognise quickly. This supports daily operations and also helps during events where many devices are checked in and out.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"9172\" data-end=\"9677\">Internal supports can be shaped to hold headsets with fixed straps, adjustable bands, or foldable frames without leaving empty gaps. When the pack is closed, these supports help the device stay centred even if the box is moved between rooms or stacked in storage racks. This is especially helpful for locations that run shared VR experiences, where devices are returned to the pack after use. Structured boxes make it easier to see if any piece is missing and encourage users to repack headsets correctly.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"9679\" data-end=\"9731\">Accessory Organisation Inside Dedicated VR Boxes<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"9733\" data-end=\"10251\">Accessories such as controllers, cable sets, lens protectors, and cleaning cloths all benefit from having their own clear spots within the pack. Cardboard VR headset boxes can include channels, pockets, or small compartments that keep these items from resting directly on the headset body. This layout supports better lens care and reduces the chance of cables pressing against sensors or delicate finishes. When customers open the pack, they can see every part at a glance and understand how the system fits together.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"10253\" data-end=\"10714\">For retailers and facilities running multiple headset models, organised internal layouts also simplify counting and stock management. Staff can quickly check that each box contains the expected range of items, which reduces support time and confusion. Over time, these structured packs help maintain order in demo areas, lending schemes, training rooms, and esports or entertainment venues. The packaging becomes an everyday tool rather than a one-time wrapper.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"10716\" data-end=\"10766\"><strong data-start=\"10716\" data-end=\"10766\">Organisation And Long-Term Handling Advantages<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"10768\" data-end=\"11296\">\n<li data-start=\"10768\" data-end=\"10835\">\n<p data-start=\"10770\" data-end=\"10835\">Supports clear compartments for controllers, cables, and extras<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10836\" data-end=\"10902\">\n<p data-start=\"10838\" data-end=\"10902\">Helps keep lens protectors and cloths away from rough surfaces<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10903\" data-end=\"10965\">\n<p data-start=\"10905\" data-end=\"10965\">Balances overall weight so boxes can be carried comfortably by hand<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10966\" data-end=\"11029\">\n<p data-start=\"10968\" data-end=\"11029\">Supports tidy storage in cupboards, lockers, and tech rooms<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11030\" data-end=\"11097\">\n<p data-start=\"11032\" data-end=\"11097\">Makes visual checks quicker when devices are returned or loaned<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11098\" data-end=\"11160\">\n<p data-start=\"11100\" data-end=\"11160\">Supports labelling systems for classrooms, labs, or venues<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11161\" data-end=\"11228\">\n<p data-start=\"11163\" data-end=\"11228\">Reduces the chance of accessories being left loose or misplaced<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11229\" data-end=\"11296\">\n<p data-start=\"11231\" data-end=\"11296\">Encourages users to handle devices and packaging with more care<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"11298\" data-end=\"11347\"><strong data-start=\"11298\" data-end=\"11347\">Practical Gains For Multi-Device Environments<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"11349\" data-end=\"11953\">\n<li data-start=\"11349\" data-end=\"11420\">\n<p data-start=\"11351\" data-end=\"11420\">Works well for standardised packaging planning during design stages<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11421\" data-end=\"11499\">\n<p data-start=\"11423\" data-end=\"11499\">Supports headset packing that includes extra components and future add-ons<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11500\" data-end=\"11576\">\n<p data-start=\"11502\" data-end=\"11576\">Improves stacking stability in warehouses and storerooms with many units<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11577\" data-end=\"11661\">\n<p data-start=\"11579\" data-end=\"11661\">Helps retailers and institutions manage different headset families in one system<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11662\" data-end=\"11742\">\n<p data-start=\"11664\" data-end=\"11742\">Allows for simple colour or icon coding on boxes for quick model recognition<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11743\" data-end=\"11809\">\n<p data-start=\"11745\" data-end=\"11809\">Gives onboarding staff an easy pack layout to learn and follow<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11810\" data-end=\"11877\">\n<p data-start=\"11812\" data-end=\"11877\">Makes shipping, lending, and returning devices more predictable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11878\" data-end=\"11953\">\n<p data-start=\"11880\" data-end=\"11953\">Extends the useful life of packaging beyond the initial purchase moment<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"11955\" data-end=\"12791\">\n<thead data-start=\"11955\" data-end=\"12082\">\n<tr data-start=\"11955\" data-end=\"12082\">\n<th data-start=\"11955\" data-end=\"11969\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"11957\" data-end=\"11968\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"11969\" data-end=\"11983\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"11971\" data-end=\"11982\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"11983\" data-end=\"12006\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"11985\" data-end=\"12005\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"12006\" data-end=\"12030\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"12008\" data-end=\"12029\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"12030\" data-end=\"12057\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"12032\" data-end=\"12056\">Add-Ons And Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"12057\" data-end=\"12082\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"12059\" data-end=\"12080\">Usage Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"12109\" data-end=\"12791\">\n<tr data-start=\"12109\" data-end=\"12272\">\n<td data-start=\"12109\" data-end=\"12127\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accessory space<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12127\" data-end=\"12167\" data-col-size=\"md\">Dedicated storage channels for extras<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12167\" data-end=\"12192\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rigid board structures<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12192\" data-end=\"12214\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gloss or soft matte<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12214\" data-end=\"12242\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Divider layouts and trays<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12242\" data-end=\"12272\" data-col-size=\"md\">VR retail and kit versions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"12273\" data-end=\"12447\">\n<td data-start=\"12273\" data-end=\"12291\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lens protection<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12291\" data-end=\"12335\" data-col-size=\"md\">Helps reduce impact and rubbing on lenses<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12335\" data-end=\"12364\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Paperboard shells and pads<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12364\" data-end=\"12386\" data-col-size=\"sm\">UV protective layer<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12386\" data-end=\"12411\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Inner padding elements<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12411\" data-end=\"12447\" data-col-size=\"md\">Shipment and equipment rotations<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"12448\" data-end=\"12616\">\n<td data-start=\"12448\" data-end=\"12466\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Balance support<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12466\" data-end=\"12509\" data-col-size=\"md\">Distributes the device weight evenly in the hand<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12509\" data-end=\"12534\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft board and liners<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12534\" data-end=\"12557\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Smooth outer texture<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12557\" data-end=\"12578\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Extra base support<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12578\" data-end=\"12616\" data-col-size=\"md\">Shelving, lockers, and demo stands<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"12617\" data-end=\"12791\">\n<td data-start=\"12617\" data-end=\"12633\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Custom sizing<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12633\" data-end=\"12675\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fits various headset and bundle formats<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12675\" data-end=\"12696\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Thick paper stocks<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12696\" data-end=\"12723\" data-col-size=\"sm\">PMS or full-colour print<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12723\" data-end=\"12746\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Logo and label zones<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"12746\" data-end=\"12791\" data-col-size=\"md\">Tech brands, venues, and training centres<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Cardboard VR headset boxes provide secure packaging for virtual reality devices, accessories, and tech components. Their firm layout prevents pressure damage and keeps the headset in place during transport or storage. Many brands purchase their packaging through <strong data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"733\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong> to maintain consistent quality for their tech shipments.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":4709,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[181],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-3140","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-by-functionality","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Cardboard VR Headset Boxes Wholesale | SCB<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"High-quality Cardboard VR Headset Boxes wholesale at SCB. Durable, customizable, and designed